    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.4/5</span><span class="text-gray-500">Enterprise-grade managed infrastructure</span></div><p class="text-gray-300">AccuWeb Hosting (founded 2003, 23+ years) sells Linux and Windows VPS built on KVM and Xen virtualization with dedicated vCPUs — no overselling — backed by ECC RAM, enterprise pure-SSD storage on RAID 6 / RAID 10, and SOC 2 Type II certified data centers across 16+ global locations. Promo pricing starts at $4.95/month for the VPS Edge plan, and every VPS ships with a 1 Gbps port, a dedicated IP, full root access, optional managed service, and DDoS mitigation up to 5 Gbps. It is a managed/enterprise-grade pick in a price band where most competitors sell minimal unmanaged KVM.</p><p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Linux VPS promo entry: $4.95/mo VPS Edge (1 vCPU, 4 GB RAM, 50 GB SSD, 250 GB) · scales to 4 vCPU / 32 GB / 400 GB / 1 TB at $19.95/mo</p></div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Dedicated vCPUs with guaranteed CPU — no overselling (KVM + Xen virtualization)</li><li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Enterprise-grade pure SSD with hardware RAID 6 &amp; RAID 10, plus separate SSD backup array and off-site backups</li><li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ ECC RAM (DDR4 / DDR5) standard — rare in the budget VPS band</li><li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 16+ verified worldwide data centers spanning US, Canada, Europe, APAC, India, and Africa, SOC 2 Type II certified</li>
    <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 23-year operating track record (founded 2003) as part of Vaghasia Group of Companies, 55,000+ hosting accounts</li>
    <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Managed and unmanaged options — setup, guidance, and under-15-minute critical-response support on managed tiers</li>
